{"last_link_id": 191, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#c09430", "widgets_values": ["路径：就是要保存的位置\n\n文件名前缀：是指统一在文件名前加上相同标识字母，如：image.txt\n\n文件名分隔符：是指前缀后面与数字填充之前的分隔符号：如：image_1.txt, 这个下划线就是分隔符\n\n文件名数字填充： 就是文件名起始数，一般都从1开始，\n\nfile_extension:代表文件的扩展名，为TXT,不能动\n\nencoding：代表文件的编码格式：utf-8，也不能动\n\nfilename_suffix：代表文件名的后缀，如：1image.txt 这里image就是文件名后缀。\n\n*****************************************************\n所以图片的文件名的数字也是要从1开始，ComfyUI_00001_.png  这是comfyui自动出图的文件名，必须保持对应，前缀要加上：ComfyUI  分隔符要加上_   数字填充填上：00001   这样就自动对应文件名输出了，但数字填充前面0000填不上，直接在前缀写上：ComfyUI_0000即可\n*****************************************************"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "保存文本参数注释", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [366.5716552734375, 492.7486572265625], "pos": [-4940.52734375, 186.57745361328125], "id": 141, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [], "size": [378.3551940917969, 315.0081481933594], "pos": [-4939.32080078125, 727.8021850585938], "widgets_values": ["D:\\AI_ToolKit\\ai-toolkit\\my_dataset\\girl1", "ComfyUI_0000", "", 1, ".txt", "utf-8", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 173, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "path"}, "name": "path", "label": "path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "path"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_delimiter"}, "name": "filename_delimiter", "label": "filename_delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_delimiter"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_number_padding"}, "name": "filename_number_padding", "label": "filename_number_padding", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "filename_number_padding"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "shape": 7, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": 